scenario cache saved without a date: protective sky, C = 1, even once the clock is known
# A cache saved before the clock was known (no Date header, no SNTP).
net down
cache unknown_age
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
expect source == PROTECTIVE
expect sky_c == 1
# Radio up and SNTP answering, only the API down: the clock is known now,
# but the cache itself has no date, so its age is still unknown.
net api_down
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
expect clock == 1
expect source == PROTECTIVE
expect why == age-unknown
expect sky_c == 1
